  data: {
    LLM: "Try to win exactly one low-value trick to avoid zero points. Avoid winning high-value cards (Pita, Aces, last trick). If you have the Pita, plan carefully as it's worth 8 points.\n\nTrack which suits opponents are void in. Use the restriction on leading coins early to your advantage. Count points taken by each player to predict who is at risk of most/least points.\n\nManipulate trick distribution to ensure you take some but not most points. Force opponents to take the Pita or last trick. Coordinate indirectly with other players to 'cover' (coprire) and prevent someone from getting zero points.",
    Player: "Try to win exactly one low-value trick to avoid zero points. Avoid winning high-value cards (Pita, Aces, last trick). If you have the Pita, plan carefully as it's worth 8 points.\n\nTrack which suits opponents are void in. Use the restriction on leading coins early to your advantage. Count points taken by each player to predict who is at risk of most/least points.\n\nManipulate trick distribution to ensure you take some but not most points. Force opponents to take the Pita or last trick. Coordinate indirectly with other players to 'cover' (coprire) and prevent someone from getting zero points.",
